{"data":[{"items":[],"id":1953,"title":"","description":"32","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Action","Drama"],"id":1953,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Commitment","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk48/shows/37a9c2f6-95bd-49d3-87f0-27bb8ec5d415.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk52/shows/65a8414c-e887-4544-9385-5e7650167cf3.jpg","likes":251,"dislikes":6,"views":13123,"release_date":"1386288000000","length":6761,"description":"After his father's botched espionage mission, North Korean Myung-hoon and his young sister Hye-in are sent to a labor prison camp. In order to save his sister's life, Myung-hoon \"volunteers\" to become a spy and infiltrates the South as a teenage defector. While attending high school in the South (his cover), he meets another girl named Hye-in and rescues her when she comes under attack by school bullies. South Korean Intelligence soon discovers Myung-hoon's activities and begins tracking him, all the while as his own government sends a vicious assassin to eliminate him.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.7}],"value":6.7,"age":"R"},"episode_id":1953,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}